<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Crowbill</h1>
<p>Type of Weapon: Distanced Hand-to-hand.
</p><p>The crowbill is a fighting pick, named for its resemblance to the bill of a crow. The most elaborate and best crafted weapons of the crowbill type were from Persia and India. The crowbill and similar picks were designed specifically to pierce through chain mail armor and plate mail joints.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla there is no crowbill skill of its own: such a weapon is fought with the skill of the kind of weapon it is. Look at it to see which (see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
